  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The introduction of a Sustainable City Manual is Sida&apos;s contribution to the process of holistic urban planning and management. Sida financed the drafting of guidelines for working with the Sustainable City approach. Two pilot city reviews were made to test the  applicability of the manual to real-life contexts of cities with varying profiles, in Skopje, Macedonia and Visakhapatnam, India.</narrative>
